      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01869",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“请你愉快地接受吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please accept it gladly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01869",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "虽说是我答应给你织，其实是千重子委托我的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although I agreed to weave it for you, it was actually Chieko who asked me to do it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01869",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你只当我是个普普通通的织布工就是。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just think of me as an ordinary weaver, that is all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01869",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "秀男对苗子说，“不过，我是诚心诚意为你织的呀。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hideo said to Naeko, \"Still, I wove it for you with all my heart.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
